    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_3NXJK4LLXJ3102K",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID2",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Instructions\n    \n      Below are 2 vague prompts that we collected from real us...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#e8f4fd; border:1px solid #b6d4fe; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:24px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#0b6fa4; margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px;\">Instructions</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:8px 0; font-size:16px; color:#333;\">\n      Below are <b>2 vague prompts</b> that we collected from real user inquiries.  \n      For each prompt, you will also see the <b>chart plan generated by a large language model (LLM)</b>.  \n      These charts are based on a dataset that can support the suggested visualizations.\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin:12px 0; font-size:16px; color:#333;\">\n      Your job is to <b>rate whether you agree with the LLM's output plan</b>.  \n      Please be <b>generous in your judgment</b> — the plan does not need to be perfect.  \n      As long as the suggested charts are <b>reasonable and relevant</b> to the vague prompt, you may consider them acceptable.\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin:12px 0 0; font-size:16px; font-weight:bold; color:#444;\">\n      You will rate each plan on:\n    </p>\n    <ul style=\"margin:8px 0 0 20px; padding:0; color:#333; font-size:15px;\">\n      <li><b>Does the generated chart plan match the intent of the vague prompt?</b> (1 = Not at all, 7 = Completely)</li>\n      <li><b>Does the generated chart plan have the potential to support further exploration?</b> (1 = Not at all, 7 = Definitely)</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n</div>",
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataExportTag": "instructions",
        "QuestionType": "DB",
        "Selector": "TB",
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        },
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
        },
        "QuestionDescription": "Instructions\n    \n      Below are 2 vague prompts that we collected from real us...",
        "ChoiceOrder": [],
        "Validation": {
          "Settings": {
            "Type": "None"
          }
        },
        "GradingData": [],
        "Language": [],
        "NextChoiceId": 4,
        "NextAnswerId": 1,
        "QuestionID": "QID2"
      }
    },
    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_3NXJK4LLXJ3102K",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID3",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "User's Vague Prompt\n    \n      \"Certain regions are reportedly safer than others...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"Certain regions are reportedly safer than others.\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Safety Score by Region</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Safety Score by Region' bar chart reveals how different regions rank in terms of safety.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Safety vs Popularity</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">Shows the relationship between safety scores and popularity scores.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataExportTag": "A-1",
